      "additional_description": "Read or save a current construction first. Check its exact Artifact ID and revision. This server check supports uncut wooden boxes at orthogonal rotations and planar screwed/glued butt-joint concepts. Correct issues by revising the same draft. Compare bounds and part count with the original requirements. concept_ready is not fabrication_ready: product instructions, fastener layout, strength, stability, cutting and publication remain separate. Failed or stale reads cannot approve anything.",
      "required_parameters": [
        "artifact_id",
        "revision"
      ],
      "optional_parameters": [],
      "envelope": {
        "type": "function",
        "schema_version": 1,
        "arguments": "JSON object validated against parameters; project binding and write provenance remain server-owned."
      },
      "expected_return": {
        "format": "json",
        "contract": "The registered handler returns its structured domain result and status; a successful write additionally returns its saved receipt. A provider tool call alone is not a saved result."
