      "description": "Edit a linked two-room drawing, not the actual building. Read the exact current drawing and its dependencies first. move_wall changes ONLY the left inside width: the fixed span and wall thickness derive both rooms; placement follows its named wall. place_furniture changes ONLY placement, never the furniture drawing or parts. refresh_sources is an explicit decision to adopt the read current source revisions and selected target, without changing parameter values. Report outside_room and stale/unavailable sources; never call an outline check safe/build-ready. All unused change fields MUST be null.",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
