      "additional_description": "Read the exact layout and dependencies. A wall move derives both room widths from the fixed span. place_furniture changes placement only. refresh_sources adopts current source versions without changing geometry parameters. Preserve unused fields as null and report out-of-room/stale conflicts. A change is saved only with a successful receipt.",
