      "additional_description": "Repair your last new-geometry render by sending only what changed; everything else is kept exactly. upsert replaces items with the same id (or adds them); remove deletes by id. Removing a definition, instance, array, clearance or motion also removes the bindings under its path; unreferenced decision/estimate/derived nodes are dropped. Add bindings for every new or changed numeric field. The result is rendered, provenance-checked and reviewed exactly like render_cad_candidate and returns the full exact recipe. Use render_cad_candidate only for a fresh construction.",
